PART 1 — per-attempt cost and break-even rarity premium after graduation
  floor F = R * FDV_grad / 1B (SOL). Attempt cost = 0.02*F + s (s = SOL minimum).
  Expected attempts to hit a tier with pool share p ~ 1/p (ignores pool drift).
  Break-even premium m* (in floors) = (0.02 + s/F) / p. Grinding is +EV iff market premium > m*.

