PART 2 — farming a whole tier: cost rises as the tier depletes (coupon-collector, pool = N)
  expected attempts to take all c items of a tier from pool N ~ N * H_c; last item alone ~ N attempts
  R=   10,000 N=100,000 floor=0.0040 s=0.003: tier c=   1: total      308.0 SOL (308.0/item avg, first 308.00, last 308.00)
