  R=1,000,000 N=  1,000 floor=0.4000 s=0.003: tier c=  10: total       32.2 SOL (3.2/item avg, first 1.10, last 11.00)
  R=  100,000 N= 10,000 floor=0.0400 s=0.01: tier c=   1: total      108.0 SOL (108.0/item avg, first 108.00, last 108.00)
